        <mxCell id="a_loss" value="&lt;b&gt;Multi-Task Loss Supervision [Detailed in (d)]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Action Classification: L_CE + L_HardNeg (triplet margin on confusable pairs)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Concept Discovery: L_BCE(P_c, M_c) + L_density (budget balance)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Hierarchy Constraints: L_parent(P_p, M_p) + L_hier (P_c &amp;le; P_parent)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#e65100;fontSize=10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="p_a">
